{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Cache rewards join the stack already in the bags (#12242)",
  "contract": [
    "A cache reward that stacks goes onto the stack of the same item already in the bags, even when an empty bag",
    "slot comes before that stack, so opening caches does not leave several part stacks of one potion (#12242).",
    "The green Adventurer's Cache (1397885) gives one green item and one supply at level 60 (adventurer-containers);",
    "every supply it can give a level-60 Barbarian is already carried once, and each stacks to 20 (item_template).",
    "Two empty slots come before every carried supply. The gear fills one, the supply joins its stack and the",
    "consumed cache frees its own slot, so two slots stay free; a new stack for the supply would leave one.",
    "None of the supplies goes to the mailbox (a mailed supply would also leave two slots free). Unstackable",
    "Recruit's Shirts (38) fill the other slots, so no filler can expire and free a slot during the test."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
